# NovaInvest — Frontend Integration Plan (Horizon UI Design System)

## Overview

Your backend is **production-ready** with 20+ API endpoints across 4 controller domains. Your frontend is currently a skeleton — 3 bare pages (Landing, Login, SignUp) and one rough [dashboard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/USER/Dev/myPersonalPortfolio/novainvest/frontend/dashboard/dashboard.tsx). 

The plan: adopt **Horizon UI's** design language (dark navy, glassmorphism cards, purple/teal accent palette) into your **existing Vite + React + TypeScript** stack — no framework switch needed. Build 3 role-specific dashboards (Client, Manager, Admin) and wire every page to your real backend APIs.

---

## What We're Keeping (Don't Touch)

| Item | Reason |
|---|---|
| `backend/` — entire backend | It's complete |
| `frontend/` Vite + React 19 | No need to switch to Next.js |
| `recharts` | Already installed, perfect for charts |
| `react-router-dom` | Already wired up |
| [GeminiAdvisor.tsx](file:///c:/Users/USER/Dev/myPersonalPortfolio/novainvest/frontend/components/GeminiAdvisor.tsx) | Premium AI advisor feature — keep & integrate into client dashboard |
| [MarketChart.tsx](file:///c:/Users/USER/Dev/myPersonalPortfolio/novainvest/frontend/components/MarketChart.tsx) | Already built, wire to `/market/quotes` |
| Landing page components | Hero, Features, Header, Footer — keep, polish |

