## What Gets Built / Changed

### 1. 🎨 Design System (`frontend/styles/`)
#### [NEW] `theme.css`
Global CSS variables based on Horizon UI palette:
- Background: `#0B1437` (deep navy)
- Card surface: `#111C44` (dark blue-grey)
- Accent primary: `#7551FF` (Horizon purple)
- Accent secondary: `#39B8FF` (electric teal)
- Success: `#01B574` (green)
- Danger: `#EE5D50` (red)
- Typography: `Inter` from Google Fonts

#### [MODIFY] [index.css](file:///c:/Users/USER/Dev/myPersonalPortfolio/novainvest/frontend/index.css)
Import `theme.css`, apply global resets, glassmorphism card utility classes.

---

### 2. 🔐 Auth Layer (`frontend/services/` + `frontend/context/`)
#### [NEW] `frontend/services/api.ts`
Central Axios instance pointing to your Express backend at `http://localhost:3000`. Handles:
- Attaches JWT Bearer token to every request
- Auto-refresh token on 401 via `/refresh`
- Typed response interfaces for all endpoints

#### [NEW] `frontend/context/AuthContext.tsx`
Global auth state (user role, token, profile). Provides:
- `useAuth()` hook
- `login()`, `logout()`, `refreshToken()` actions
- Persistent login via `localStorage`

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/components/Login.tsx](file:///c:/Users/USER/Dev/myPersonalPortfolio/novainvest/frontend/components/Login.tsx)
Wire to `POST /login` and `POST /register`. Redirect by role:
- `USER` → `/dashboard/client`
- `MANAGER` → `/dashboard/manager`
- `ADMIN` → `/dashboard/admin`

---

### 3. 🛡️ Route Protection
#### [NEW] `frontend/components/ProtectedRoute.tsx`
Wraps dashboard routes. Checks role from `AuthContext`, redirects unauthorised users to `/login`.

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/USER/Dev/myPersonalPortfolio/novainvest/frontend/App.tsx)
Add role-protected routes:
```
/dashboard/client   → <ClientDashboard />   (USER only)
/dashboard/manager  → <ManagerDashboard />  (MANAGER only)
/dashboard/admin    → <AdminDashboard />    (ADMIN only)
```

---

