| **Market Ticker** | `GET /market/quotes` | Live stock prices from Alpha Vantage |
| **Buy / Sell Modal** | `POST /client/buy-stock` / `POST /client/sell-stock` | Trade execution form |
| **My Manager Card** | `GET /client/dashboard` | Manager name, status, avatar |
| **Link Manager** | `POST /client/add-manager` | Search & assign manager |
| **AI Advisor Panel** | (existing [GeminiAdvisor.tsx](file:///c:/Users/USER/Dev/myPersonalPortfolio/novainvest/frontend/components/GeminiAdvisor.tsx)) | Already built — embed here |
| **Transaction History** | `GET /client/dashboard` | Table of past trades |

