---

### 8. 📦 New Dependencies to Install

```bash
npm install axios @chakra-ui/react @emotion/react @emotion/styled framer-motion
```

| Package | Why |
|---|---|
| `axios` | Clean HTTP client for API calls |
| `@chakra-ui/react` | Horizon UI is Chakra-based — gives us their component primitives |
| `@emotion/react` + `styled` | Required by Chakra |
| `framer-motion` | Smooth page transitions and widget animations |

---

## Verification Plan

### Manual Testing (step-by-step)
1. Run backend: `cd backend && npm run dev` (server on port 3000)
2. Run frontend: `cd frontend && npm run dev` (Vite on port 5173)
3. Register a new user → confirm email → login → verify redirect to `/dashboard/client`
4. On client dashboard: check portfolio card loads, market quote ticker shows prices
5. Execute a buy → verify it appears in transaction history
6. Login as Manager → confirm pending requests appear → approve one → verify client reflects it
7. Login as Admin → verify all tables load with real data
8. Try accessing `/dashboard/admin` as a USER → confirm redirect to `/login`

### Build Check
```bash
cd frontend && npm run build
```
Must complete with zero TypeScript errors.
